    <item>
      <title>关于如何白嫖原价600元的阿里云ACA大模型工程师证书认证资格(需要学生认证)</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2456810</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2456810</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 06:16:19 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;白嫖前说明：需要佬友们有阿里云的学生认证身份哟~（应届生好像也行）&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;以下为ACA大模型工程师介绍：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;阿里云认证是结合阿里云丰富的行业实践和生态企业人才需求，输出针对泛云生态人才标准的专业认证，覆盖大模型、云计算、大数据等多个技术领域，面向学生、技术工程师、架构师等群体。阿里云认证包含开发者Clouder认证和职业岗位认证。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/b/a/d/badb4aebd7c62c522905f36f221f8ede5fded3b8.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/qF0DNjZ3VUB9TM79jXOvDKwSoPK.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;008180526a177930ef7b3d938e33604a&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/b/a/d/badb4aebd7c62c522905f36f221f8ede5fded3b8_2_500x375.png&quot; alt=&quot;008180526a177930ef7b3d938e33604a&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;qF0DNjZ3VUB9TM79jXOvDKwSoPK&quot; width=&quot;500&quot; height=&quot;375&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/b/a/d/badb4aebd7c62c522905f36f221f8ede5fded3b8_2_500x375.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/b/a/d/badb4aebd7c62c522905f36f221f8ede5fded3b8_2_750x562.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/b/a/d/badb4aebd7c62c522905f36f221f8ede5fded3b8_2_1000x750.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F5F4F4&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;以下为过程：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1、首先打开网址，完成学生认证，领取300元的抵扣金 &lt;a href=&quot;https://university.aliyun.com/course/promotion25-activity?clubTaskBiz=subTask..12690075..10273..&amp;userCode=gq9foqgf&quot; class=&quot;inline-onebox&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;第25期云工开物高校激励计划—助力有礼活动页&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/4/d/f4d7e29add7b2ab5083a52ed4b7d0b6e3b2088d7.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/yVZ29aStgLV6TviwbO5Q07ZI7d5.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;f9ba861f72009eb55572112ae9ecfb48&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/4/d/f4d7e29add7b2ab5083a52ed4b7d0b6e3b2088d7_2_517x192.png&quot; alt=&quot;f9ba861f72009eb55572112ae9ecfb48&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;yVZ29aStgLV6TviwbO5Q07ZI7d5&quot; width=&quot;517&quot; height=&quot;192&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/4/d/f4d7e29add7b2ab5083a52ed4b7d0b6e3b2088d7_2_517x192.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/4/d/f4d7e29add7b2ab5083a52ed4b7d0b6e3b2088d7_2_775x288.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/4/d/f4d7e29add7b2ab5083a52ed4b7d0b6e3b2088d7_2_1034x384.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;ECE8E8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2、领取完后往下滑，看到大模型认证这一栏，点击立即购买，用券刚好抵消费用&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/1/c/1/1c1c38999345401675ccf25ce17e3a5b3707d761.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/40FPCsCtGqab1dN9ThhDEp7G6UV.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;3bfe5241db326458122e22f452008d0f&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/c/1/1c1c38999345401675ccf25ce17e3a5b3707d761_2_517x317.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;3bfe5241db326458122e22f452008d0f&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;40FPCsCtGqab1dN9ThhDEp7G6UV&quot; width=&quot;517&quot; height=&quot;317&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/c/1/1c1c38999345401675ccf25ce17e3a5b3707d761_2_517x317.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/c/1/1c1c38999345401675ccf25ce17e3a5b3707d761_2_775x475.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/c/1/1c1c38999345401675ccf25ce17e3a5b3707d761_2_1034x634.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F1F0F8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;虽然只是面向初学者的一个证，但是正经人谁花那个钱啊～&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;5 个帖子 - 4 位参与者&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2456810&quot;&gt;阅读完整话题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
          </description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>【福利】微软Bing免积分领取美团20-20红包</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2456707</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2456707</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 06:06:40 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;1.打开你的Edge浏览器，访问 &lt;a href=&quot;https://rewards.bing.com/promo/worldcup-china&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;熬夜看球能量补给站 — Microsoft Rewards&lt;/a&gt; 或者 &lt;a href=&quot;https://cn.bing.com/cnevents/home&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;微软必应 畅享世界杯&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2.下划找到美团、麦当劳等礼品&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/c/5/4/c540d5210e197b3bba7b9ce208c4c339ac520c2b.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/s8YXOtQJRGQ7Xdpwk5NIEGPZWtR.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/5/4/c540d5210e197b3bba7b9ce208c4c339ac520c2b_2_690x345.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;s8YXOtQJRGQ7Xdpwk5NIEGPZWtR&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;345&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/5/4/c540d5210e197b3bba7b9ce208c4c339ac520c2b_2_690x345.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/5/4/c540d5210e197b3bba7b9ce208c4c339ac520c2b_2_1035x517.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/5/4/c540d5210e197b3bba7b9ce208c4c339ac520c2b_2_1380x690.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F3DACF&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3.点击“点击兑换”后，会弹出一个新页面，自动打开侧边栏弹出一个美团福利，点击领取&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;然后在订单页查看兑换码&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/b/4/a/b4ab94df22eed425d160e00dd65fc0f6c08e1f91.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/pMhyuQNtjhDBWfLc1CZGyQywbu1.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/b/4/a/b4ab94df22eed425d160e00dd65fc0f6c08e1f91_2_689x209.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;pMhyuQNtjhDBWfLc1CZGyQywbu1&quot; width=&quot;689&quot; height=&quot;209&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/b/4/a/b4ab94df22eed425d160e00dd65fc0f6c08e1f91_2_689x209.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/b/4/a/b4ab94df22eed425d160e00dd65fc0f6c08e1f91_2_1033x313.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/b/4/a/b4ab94df22eed425d160e00dd65fc0f6c08e1f91.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;C4C2BE&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;随后打开手机美团，我的-红包卡券-右上角三个点-兑换码-其他优惠券，输入兑换码即可获得&lt;br&gt;
